{"id": "mawangdui-yi.001", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "38", "text": "上德不德是以有德下德不失德是以無德上德無為而無以為也上仁為之而無以為也上○為之而有以為也上禮為之而莫之應也則攘臂而乃之故失道而后德失德而句仁失仁而句義∠失義而句禮夫禮者忠信之泊也而亂之首也前識者道之華也而愚之首也是以大丈夫居□□□居亓泊居亓實而不居亓華故去罷而取此‧", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "38 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "other", "as_source": "∠", "offset": 75}, {"type": "other", "as_source": "‧", "offset": 132}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 112, "end": 115}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.002", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "39", "text": "昔得一者天得一以清地得一以寧神得一以霝浴得一盈侯王得一以為天下正亓至也胃天毌已清將恐蓮地毌已寧將恐發神毌□□□恐歇谷毌已□將渴侯王毌已貴以高將恐蹶故必貴以賤為本必高矣而以下為基夫是以侯王自胃孤寡不穀此亓賤之本與非也故至數輿無輿是故不欲祿﹦若玉硌﹦若石", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "39 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 118}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 122}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 52, "end": 55}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 60, "end": 61}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.003", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "40", "text": "反也者道之動也□□者道之用也天下之物生於有﹦於無", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "40 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 21}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 7, "end": 9}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.004", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "41", "text": "上□□道堇能行之中士聞道若存若亡下士聞道大笑之弗笑□□以為道‧是以建言有之曰明道如費進道如退夷道如類上德如浴大白如辱廣德如不足建德如□質□□□大方無禺大器免成大音希聲天象無刑道褒無名‧夫唯道善始且善成", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "41 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "other", "as_source": "‧", "offset": 30}, {"type": "other", "as_source": "‧", "offset": 91}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 1, "end": 3}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 25, "end": 27}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 66, "end": 67}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 68, "end": 71}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.005", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "42", "text": "道生一﹦生二﹦生三﹦生□□□□□□□□□□□以為和人之所亞唯孤寡不穀而王公以自□□□□□□□云﹦之而益□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□吾將以□□父", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "42 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 3}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 6}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 9}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 47}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 11, "end": 22}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 39, "end": 46}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 51, "end": 67}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 70, "end": 72}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.006", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "43", "text": "天下之至□馳騁乎天下□□□□□□□□□無閒吾是以□□□□□□也不□□□□□□□□□□□□□矣", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "43 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 4, "end": 5}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 10, "end": 19}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 24, "end": 30}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 32, "end": 45}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.007", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "44", "text": "名與□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "44 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 2, "end": 39}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.008", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "45", "text": "□□□□□□□□□盈如沖亓□□□□□□□□□□□□巧如掘□□□絀趮朕寒□□□□□□□□□□□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "45 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 0, "end": 9}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 13, "end": 25}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 28, "end": 31}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 35, "end": 47}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.009", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "46", "text": "□□□道卻走馬□糞無道戎馬生於郊罪莫大可欲禍□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□足矣", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "46 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 0, "end": 3}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 7, "end": 8}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 22, "end": 40}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.010", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "47", "text": "不出於戶以知天下不窺於□□知天道亓出彌遠者亓知彌□□□□□□□□□□□而名弗為而成", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "47 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 11, "end": 13}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 24, "end": 35}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.011", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "48", "text": "為學者日益聞道者日云﹦之有云以至於無□□□□□□□□□□取天下恆無事及亓有事也□□足以取天□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "48 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 10}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 18, "end": 28}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 39, "end": 41}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 45, "end": 47}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.012", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "49", "text": "□人恆無心以百省之心為心善□□□□□□□□□□善也信者信之不信者亦信之德信也聖人之在天下也歙﹦焉□□□□□□生皆注亓□□□□□□□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "49 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 46}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 0, "end": 1}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 13, "end": 23}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 48, "end": 54}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 58, "end": 66}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.013", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "50", "text": "□生入死生之□□□□□之徒十又三而民生﹦僮皆之死地之十有三□何故也以亓生﹦蓋聞善執生者陵行不辟兕虎入軍不被兵革兕無□□□□□□□□亓蚤兵□□□□□□□□也以亓無□□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "50 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 19}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 36}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 0, "end": 1}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 6, "end": 11}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 29, "end": 30}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 57, "end": 65}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 68, "end": 76}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 80, "end": 83}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.014", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "51", "text": "道生之德畜之物刑之而器成之是以萬物尊道而貴德道之尊也德之貴也夫莫之爵也而恆自然也道生之畜□□□□之亭之毒之養之復□□□□□□□□□□□弗宰是胃玄德", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "51 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 44, "end": 48}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 56, "end": 67}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.015", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "52", "text": "天下有始以為天下母既得亓母以知亓子既○知亓子復守亓母沒身不佁塞亓兌閉亓門冬身不堇啟亓兌齊亓□□□不棘見小曰明守□□強用□□□□□□□遺身央是胃□常", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "52 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 45, "end": 48}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 55, "end": 57}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 59, "end": 66}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 71, "end": 72}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.016", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "53", "text": "使我介有知行於大道唯他是畏大道甚夷民甚好徑朝甚除田甚蕪倉甚虛服文采帶利劍厭食而齎財□□□□盜□□□非□也", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "53 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 41, "end": 45}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 46, "end": 49}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 50, "end": 51}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.017", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "54", "text": "善建者□□□□□□□子孫以祭祀不絕脩之身亓德乃真脩之家亓德有餘脩之鄉亓德乃長脩之國亓德乃夆脩之天下亓德乃博以身觀身以家觀□□□□國以天下觀天下吾何□知天下之然茲以□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "54 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 3, "end": 10}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 60, "end": 64}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 73, "end": 74}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 81, "end": 82}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.018", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "55", "text": "含德之厚者比於赤子蜂癘虫蛇弗赫據鳥孟獸弗捕骨筋弱柔而握固∠未知牝牡之會而朘怒精之至也冬日號而不嚘和□□□□□□常知常曰明益生□祥心使氣曰強物□則老胃之不﹦道﹦蚤已", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "55 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "other", "as_source": "∠", "offset": 28}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 76}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 78}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 49, "end": 55}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 62, "end": 63}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 70, "end": 71}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.019", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "56", "text": "知者弗言﹦者弗知塞亓兌閉亓門和亓光同亓塵銼亓兌而解亓紛是胃玄同故不可得而親也亦□□得而□□□得而○利□□□得而害不可得而貴亦不可得而賤故為天下貴", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "56 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 4}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 39, "end": 41}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 43, "end": 46}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 50, "end": 53}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.020", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "57", "text": "以正之國以畸用兵以無事取天下吾何以知亓然也才夫天下多忌諱而民彌貧民多利器□□□□昏□□□□□□□□□□物茲章而盜賊□□是以□人之言曰我無為而民自化我好靜而民自正我無事而民自富我欲不欲而民自樸", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "57 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 36, "end": 40}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 41, "end": 51}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 57, "end": 59}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 61, "end": 62}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.021", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "58", "text": "亓正閔﹦亓民屯﹦亓正察﹦亓□□□福□之所伏孰知亓極□無正也正□□□善復為□□之悉也亓日固久矣是以方而不割兼而不刺直而不紲光而不眺", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "58 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 3}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 7}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 11}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 13, "end": 16}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 17, "end": 18}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 25, "end": 26}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 30, "end": 33}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 36, "end": 38}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.022", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "59", "text": "治人事天莫若嗇夫唯嗇是以蚤﹦服﹦是胃重﹦積□□□□□□□□□□□莫﹦知﹦亓﹦□□□□有﹦國﹦之母可□□久是胃□根固氏長生久視之道也", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "59 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 13}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 15}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 19}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 33}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 35}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 37}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 43}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 45}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 21, "end": 32}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 38, "end": 42}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 49, "end": 51}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 54, "end": 55}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.023", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "60", "text": "治大國若亨小鮮以道立天下亓鬼不神非亓鬼不神也亓神不傷人也非亓神不傷人也□□□弗傷也夫兩□相傷故德交歸焉", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "60 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 35, "end": 38}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 43, "end": 44}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.024", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "61", "text": "大國□□□□□□□牝也天下之交也牝恆以靜朕牡為亓靜也故宜為下也故大國以下□國則取小﹦國﹦以下大國則取於大國故或下□□□下而取故大國者不□欲並畜人小國不□欲入事人夫□□亓欲則大者宜為下", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "61 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 41}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 43}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 2, "end": 9}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 36, "end": 37}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 56, "end": 59}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 67, "end": 68}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 75, "end": 76}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 81, "end": 83}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.025", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "62", "text": "道者萬物之注也善人之保也不善人之所葆也美言可以市尊行可以賀人﹦之不善何□□□□立天子置三鄉雖有□□璧以先四馬不若坐而進此古□□□□□□□□□不胃求以得有罪以免與故為天下貴", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "62 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 30}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 35, "end": 39}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 47, "end": 49}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 61, "end": 70}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.026", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "63", "text": "為無為□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□乎亓細也天下之□□□易天下之大□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□夫輕若□□信多易必多難是以聖人□□之故□□□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "63 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 3, "end": 25}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 32, "end": 35}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 40, "end": 55}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 58, "end": 60}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 70, "end": 72}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 74, "end": 78}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.027", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "64", "text": "□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□木作於毫末九成之臺作於欙土百千之高始於足不為之者敗之執者失之是以聖人無為□□□□□□□□□□□□民之從事也恆於亓成而敗之故曰慎冬若始則無敗事矣是以聖人欲不欲而不貴難得之貨學不學復眾人之所過能輔萬物之自然而弗敢為", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "64 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 0, "end": 38}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 74, "end": 86}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.028", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "65", "text": "古之為道者非以明□□□□□之也夫民之難治也以亓知也故以知﹦國﹦之賊也以不知﹦國﹦之德也恆知此兩者亦稽式也恆知稽式是胃玄﹦德﹦深矣遠矣□物反也乃至大順", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "65 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 28}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 30}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 37}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 39}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 59}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 61}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 8, "end": 13}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 66, "end": 67}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.029", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "66", "text": "江海所以能為百浴□□□亓□下之也是以能為百浴王是以聖人之欲上民也必以亓言下之亓欲先民也必以亓身後之故居上而民弗重也居前而民弗害天下皆樂誰而弗猒也不□亓無爭與故天下莫能與爭", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "66 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 8, "end": 11}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 12, "end": 13}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 73, "end": 74}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.030", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "67", "text": "天下□胃我大﹦而不宵夫唯不宵故能大若宵久矣亓細也夫我恆有三保市而保之一曰茲‧二曰檢三曰不敢為天下先夫茲故能勇檢敢能廣不敢為天下先故能為成器長今舍亓茲且勇舍亓檢且廣舍亓後且先則死矣夫茲以單則朕以守則固天將建之如以茲垣之", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "67 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 6}, {"type": "other", "as_source": "‧", "offset": 37}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 2, "end": 3}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.031", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "68", "text": "故善為士者不武善單者不怒善朕敵者弗與善用人者為之下是胃不爭□德是胃用人是胃肥天古之極也", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "68 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 29, "end": 30}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.032", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "69", "text": "用兵又言曰吾不敢為主而為客不敢進寸而退尺是胃行無行攘無臂∠執無兵乃無敵禍莫大於無﹦敵﹦近○亡吾保矣故抗兵相若而依者朕□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "69 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "other", "as_source": "∠", "offset": 28}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 40}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 42}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 58, "end": 59}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.033", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "70", "text": "吾言易知也易行也而天下莫之能知也莫之能行也夫言又宗事又君夫唯無知也是以不我知﹦者希則我貴矣是以聖人被褐而褱玉", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "70 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 38}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.034", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "71", "text": "知不知尚矣不知﹦病矣是以聖人之不□也以亓病﹦也是以不病", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "71 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 7}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 21}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 16, "end": 17}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.035", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "72", "text": "民之不畏‧則大畏將至矣毌狹亓所居毌猒亓所生夫唯弗猒是以不猒是以聖人自知而不自見也自愛而不自貴也故去罷而取此", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "72 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "other", "as_source": "‧", "offset": 4}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.036", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "73", "text": "勇於敢則殺勇於不敢則栝□兩者或利或害天之所亞孰知亓故天之道不單而善朕不言而善應弗召而自來單而善謀天罔恢﹦疏而不失", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "73 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 51}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 11, "end": 12}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.037", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "74", "text": "若民恆且○不畏死若何以殺懼之也使民恆且畏死而為畸者□得而殺之夫孰敢矣若民恆且必畏死則恆又司殺者夫代司殺者殺是代大匠斲夫代大匠斲則希不傷亓手", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "74 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 25, "end": 26}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.038", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "75", "text": "人之飢也以亓取食稅之多是以飢百生之不治也以亓上之有以為也□以不治民之輕死也以亓求生之厚也是以輕死夫唯無以生為者是賢貴生", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "75 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 28, "end": 29}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.039", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "76", "text": "人之生也柔弱亓死也恆信堅強萬□□木之生也柔脆亓死也桔槁故曰堅強死之徒也柔弱生之徒也□以兵強則不朕木強則兢故強大居下柔弱居上", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "76 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 14, "end": 16}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 41, "end": 42}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.040", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "77", "text": "天之道酉張弓也高者印之下者舉之有余者云之不足者□□□□□□□云有余而益不足人之道云不足而奉又余夫孰能又余而□□奉於天之唯又道者乎是以聖人為而弗又成功而弗居也若此亓不欲見賢也", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "77 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 23, "end": 30}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 53, "end": 55}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.041", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "78", "text": "天下莫柔弱於水□□□□□□□□□以亓無以易之也水之朕剛也弱之朕強也天下莫弗知也而□□□□也是故聖人之言云曰受國之詬是胃社稷之主受國之不祥是胃天下之王正言若反", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "78 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 7, "end": 16}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 40, "end": 44}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.042", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "79", "text": "禾大□□□□□□□□為善是以聖人執左芥而不以責於人故又德司芥無德司徹□□□□□□□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "79 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 2, "end": 10}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 34, "end": 42}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.043", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "80", "text": "小國寡民使有十百人器而勿用使民重死而遠徙又周車無所乘之有甲兵無所陳之使民復結繩而用之甘亓食美亓服樂亓俗安亓居鄰國相望雞犬之□□聞民至老死不相往來", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "80 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 61, "end": 63}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.044", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "81", "text": "信言不美﹦言不信知者不博﹦者不知善者不多﹦者不善聖人無積既以為人己俞有既以予人矣己俞多故天之道利而不害人之道為而弗爭", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "81 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 4}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 12}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 20}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.045", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "1", "text": "道可道也□□□□□□□□恆名也無名萬物之始也有名萬物之母也故恆無欲也□□□□恆又欲也以觀亓所噭兩者同出異名同胃玄之又玄眾眇之門", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "1 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 4, "end": 12}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 34, "end": 38}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.046", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "2", "text": "天下皆知美之為美亞已皆知善斯不善矣□□□□生也難易之相成也長短之相刑也高下之相盈也音聲之相和也先後之相隋恆也是以聖人居無為之事行不言之教萬物昔而弗始為而弗侍也成功而弗居也夫唯弗居是以弗去", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "2 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 17, "end": 21}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.047", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "3", "text": "不上賢使民不爭不貴難得之貨使民不為盜不見可欲使民不亂是以聖人之治也虛亓心實亓腹弱亓志強亓骨恆使民無知無欲也使夫知不敢弗為而已則無不治矣", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "3 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.048", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "4", "text": "道沖而用之有弗盈也淵呵佁萬物之宗銼亓兌解亓芬和亓光同亓塵湛呵佁或存吾不知亓誰之子也象帝之先", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "4 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.049", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "5", "text": "天地不仁以萬物為芻狗聖人不仁□百姓為芻狗天地之閒亓猷橐籥輿虛而不淈動而俞出多聞數窮不若守於中", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "5 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 14, "end": 15}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.050", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "6", "text": "浴神不死是胃玄﹦牝﹦之門是胃天地之根縣﹦呵亓若存用之不堇", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "6 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 7}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 9}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 19}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.051", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "7", "text": "天長地久天地之所以能長且久者以亓不自生也故能長生是以聖人退亓身而身先外亓身而身先外亓身而身存不以亓無私輿故能成亓私", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "7 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.052", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "8", "text": "上善如水﹦善利萬物而有爭居眾人之所亞故幾於道矣居善地心善淵予善天言善信正善治事善能動善時夫唯不爭故無尤", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "8 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 4}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.053", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "9", "text": "植而盈之不若亓已鍛而允之不可長葆也金玉盈室莫之能守也貴富而驕自遺咎也功遂身退天之道也", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "9 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.054", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "10", "text": "戴營魄抱一能毌離乎專氣至柔能嬰兒乎脩除玄監能毌有疵乎愛民栝國能毌以知乎天門啟闔能為雌乎明白四達能毌以知乎生之畜之生而弗有長而弗宰也是胃玄德", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "10 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.055", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "11", "text": "卅楅同一轂當亓無有車之用也然埴而為器當亓無有埴器之用也戶牖當亓無有室之用也故有之以為利無之以為用∠", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "11 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "other", "as_source": "∠", "offset": 48}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.056", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "12", "text": "五色使人目盲馳騁田臘使人心發狂難得之貨○使人之行仿五味使人之口爽五音使人之耳□是以聖人之治也為腹而不為目故去彼而取此", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "12 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 38, "end": 39}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.057", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "13", "text": "弄辱若驚貴大患若身何胃弄辱若驚弄之為下也得之若驚失之若驚是胃弄辱若驚何胃貴大患若身吾所以有大患者為吾有身也及吾無身有何患故貴為身於為天下若可以橐天下□愛以身為天下女可以寄天下矣", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "13 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 74, "end": 75}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.058", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "14", "text": "視之而弗見□之曰微聽之而弗聞命之曰希昏之而弗得命之曰夷三者不可至計故混而為一﹦者亓上不謬亓下不忽尋﹦呵不可命也復歸於無物是胃無狀之狀無物之象是胃忽望隋而不見亓後迎而不見亓首執今之道以御今之有以知古始是胃道紀", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "14 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 38}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 49}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 5, "end": 6}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.059", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "15", "text": "古之屳為道者微眇玄達深不可志夫唯不可志故強為之容曰與呵亓若冬涉水猷呵亓若畏四鄰嚴呵亓若客浼呵亓若淩澤沌呵亓若樸春呵亓若濁莊呵亓若浴濁而靜之徐清女以重之徐生葆此道□□欲盈是以能敝而不成", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "15 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 80, "end": 82}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.060", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "16", "text": "至虛極也守靜督也萬物旁作吾以觀亓復也天物雲﹦各復歸於亓根曰靜﹦是胃復﹦命﹦常也知常明也不知常芒﹦作凶知常容﹦乃公﹦乃王□□天﹦乃道﹦乃沒身不殆", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "16 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 21}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 30}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 34}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 36}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 47}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 53}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 56}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 62}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 65}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 59, "end": 61}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.061", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "17", "text": "大上下知又□亓□親譽之亓次畏之亓下母之信不足安有不信猷呵亓貴言也成功遂事而百姓胃我自然", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "17 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 5, "end": 6}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 7, "end": 8}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.062", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "18", "text": "故大道廢安有仁義知慧出安有□□六親不和安又孝茲國家昏亂安有貞臣", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "18 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 13, "end": 15}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.063", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "19", "text": "絕聖棄知而民利百倍絕仁棄義而民復孝茲絕巧棄利盜賊無有此三言也以為文未足故令之有所屬見素抱樸少□而寡欲", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "19 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 46, "end": 47}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.064", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "20", "text": "絕學無憂唯與呵亓相去幾何美與亞亓相去何若人之所畏亦不可以不畏人朢呵亓未央才眾人熙﹦若鄉於大牢而春登臺我博焉未垗若嬰兒未咳纍呵佁無所歸眾人皆又余我愚人之心也春﹦呵鬻人昭﹦我獨若昏呵鬻人察﹦我獨閩﹦呵忽呵亓若海朢呵若無所止眾人皆有以我獨門元以鄙吾欲獨異於人而貴食母", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "20 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 40}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 78}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 83}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 92}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 96}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.065", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "21", "text": "孔德之容唯道是從道之物唯朢唯忽﹦呵朢呵中又象呵朢呵忽呵中有物呵幼呵冥呵亓中有請呵亓請甚真亓中有信自今及古亓名不去以順眾父吾何以知眾父之然也以此", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "21 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 15}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.066", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "22", "text": "曲則全汪則正洼則盈敝則新少則得多則惑是以聖人執一以為天下牧不自視故章不自見也故明不自伐故有功弗矜故能長夫唯不爭故莫能與之爭古之所胃曲全者幾語才誠全歸之", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "22 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.067", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "23", "text": "希言自然剽風不冬朝暴雨不冬日孰為此天地而弗能久有兄於人乎故從事而道者同於道德者同於德失者同於失同於德者道亦德之同於失者道亦失之", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "23 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.068", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "24", "text": "炊者不立自視者不章自見者不明自伐者無功自矜者不長亓在道也曰餘食贅行物或亞之故有欲者弗居", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "24 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.069", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "25", "text": "有物昆成先天地生蕭呵漻呵獨立而不改可以為天地母吾未知亓名也字之曰道吾強為之名曰大﹦曰筮﹦曰遠﹦曰反道大天大地大人亦大國中有四大而王居一焉人法地﹦法天﹦法道﹦法自然", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "25 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 40}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 43}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 46}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 71}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 74}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 77}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.070", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "26", "text": "重為輕根靜為躁君是以君子冬日行不遠亓甾重雖有環官燕處則昭若﹦何萬乘之王而以身輕於天下輕則失本躁則失君", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "26 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 29}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.071", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "27", "text": "善行者無達跡善言者無瑕適善數者不用篿策善○閉者無關籥而不可啟也善結者無纆約而不可解也是以聖人恆善救人而無棄人物無棄財是胃曳明故善﹦人﹦之師不善人善人之資也不貴亓師不愛亓資雖知乎大迷是胃眇要", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "27 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 64}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 66}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.072", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "28", "text": "知亓雄守亓雌為﹦天﹦下﹦雞﹦恆﹦德﹦不﹦離﹦復□□□□□亓白守亓辱為﹦天﹦下﹦○浴﹦恆﹦德﹦乃﹦足﹦復歸於樸知亓白守亓黑為﹦天﹦下﹦式﹦恆﹦德﹦不﹦貸﹦復歸於無極樸散則為器聖人用則為官長夫大制無割", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "28 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 7}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 9}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 11}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 13}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 15}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 17}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 19}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 21}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 34}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 36}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 38}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 41}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 43}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 45}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 47}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 49}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 61}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 63}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 65}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 67}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 69}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 71}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 73}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 75}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 23, "end": 28}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.073", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "29", "text": "將欲取□□□□□□□□□得已夫天下神器也非可為者也為之者敗之執之者失之○物或行或隋或熱或坐或陪或墮是以聖人去甚去大去諸", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "29 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 3, "end": 12}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.074", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "30", "text": "以道佐人主不以兵強於天下亓□□□□□□□□棘生之善者果而已矣毌以取強焉果而毌驕果而勿矜果□□傷果而毌得已居是胃果而強物壯而老胃之不﹦道﹦蚤已∠", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "30 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 65}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 67}, {"type": "other", "as_source": "∠", "offset": 70}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 13, "end": 21}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 44, "end": 46}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.075", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "31", "text": "夫兵者不祥之器也物或亞□□□□□□□□子居則貴左用兵則貴右故兵者非君子之器兵者不祥□器也不得已而用之銛龍為上勿美也若美之是樂殺人也夫樂殺人不可以得志於天下矣是以吉事□□□□□□是以偏將軍居左而上將軍居右言以喪禮居之也殺□□□□□立□□朕而以喪禮處之", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "31 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 11, "end": 19}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 41, "end": 42}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 82, "end": 88}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 109, "end": 114}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 115, "end": 117}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.076", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "32", "text": "道恆無名樸唯小而天下弗敢臣侯王若能守之萬物將自賓天地相合以俞甘洛□□□令而自均焉始制有名﹦亦既有夫亦將知﹦止﹦所以不殆卑□□在天下也猷小浴之與江海也", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "32 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 44}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 52}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 54}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 32, "end": 35}, {"kind": "missing", "start": 60, "end": 62}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.077", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "33", "text": "知人者知也自知明也朕人者有力也自朕者強也知足者富也強行者有志也不失亓所者久也死而不忘者壽也", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "33 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.078", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "34", "text": "道渢呵亓可左右也成功遂□□弗名有也萬物歸焉而弗為主則恆無欲也可名於小萬物歸焉而弗為主可命於大是以聖人之能成大也以亓不為大也故能成大", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "34 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 11, "end": 13}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.079", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "35", "text": "執大象天下往﹦而不害安平大樂與□過格止故道之出言也曰淡呵亓無味也見之不足見也聽之不足聞也用之不可既也", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "35 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 6}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 15, "end": 16}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.080", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "36", "text": "將欲翕之必古張之將欲弱之必古○強之將欲去之必古與之將欲奪之必古予□是胃微明柔弱朕強魚不可說於淵國利器不可以示人", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "36 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 32, "end": 33}]}
{"id": "mawangdui-yi.081", "witness": "mawangdui-yi", "unit_type": "chapter", "unit_no": "37", "text": "道恆無名侯王若能守之萬物將自化﹦而欲作吾將闐﹦之﹦以﹦無﹦名﹦之﹦樸﹦夫將不﹦辱﹦以靜天地將自正", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-boshu", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-boshu/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "37 - 章/下段（乙本）"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 15}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 22}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 24}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 26}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 28}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 30}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 32}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 34}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 38}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "﹦", "offset": 40}]}
